  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab>Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market.<lb/>
               This <hi rend="allcaps">evening</hi>, <date when="1811-05-29">Wednesday, May 29, 1811</date><lb/>
               Will be perform'd (By Permission of the Proprietors of the Theatre-Royal, Covent-Garden)<lb/>
               the Musical Piece of<lb/>
               <bibl><title>Paul and Virginia.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Paul,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Paine</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Alambra,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Wheatley</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Tropic,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Shaw</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Don Anthonio,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Dominique,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mallinson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Diego,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lewes</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Sebastian,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Officer,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hodson</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Sailor,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Haughton</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Virginia,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Jacintha,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watston</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Mary,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Stokes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Chorus of Inhabitants,</role> Messrs. <actor>Linton,</actor> <actor>Eames,</actor> <actor>Terry,</actor> <actor>Griffith,</actor> <actor>Oddwell,</actor> <actor>Willoughby,</actor><lb/>
                     <actor>Diether,</actor> <actor>Caulfield,</actor> <actor>Harrison,</actor> <actor>Warner,</actor> &amp;c.<lb/>
                     Messdms. <actor>De Camp,</actor> <actor>Stokes,</actor> <actor>Kendall,</actor> <actor>Haughton,</actor> <actor>Danton.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               The Dances by Messrs. Wells, Hope, Taylor, Widdicombe, Cross, Brown, &amp;c.<lb/>
               Messdms. Stokes, Barrett, Taylor, Danton, Haughton, Byrne.<lb/>
               After which (<hi rend="allcaps">Fourth Time</hi>) A Comick Piece in Two Acts, call'd The<lb/>
               <bibl><title>Trial by Jury.</title></bibl><lb/>
               With <hi rend="allcaps">New Scenery, Dresses</hi>, &amp;c.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barnes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">R. Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem>And <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               To which will be added, the Comedy of<lb/>
               <bibl><title>Three Weeks After Marriage.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Sir Charles Racket,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Drugget,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barnes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Woodley,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Servant,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Widdicombe</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lady Racket,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Glover</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Miss Drugget,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Nancy,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Dimity,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Boxes</hi> <measure type="currency">5s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Pit</hi> <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">First Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Second Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">1s</measure>.<lb/>
               The Doors to be Opened at <time when="18:00:00">Six o'Clock</time>, and the Performance to begin at <time when="19:00:00">Seven</time>.<lb/>
               Places for the Boxes to be taken of Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Massingham</hi> at the Theatre.<lb/>
               The Publick is respectfully inform'd that The New Comick Piece of The <hi rend="allcaps">Trial</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">By Jury</hi> having been receieved, on its Third Representation, with unbounded and rei-<lb/>
               terated applause, will be repeated every evening, till further notice.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
  </text>
